# Dion, Bahamut's Dominant: {4}{W}{W}, {T} at sorcery speed exiles Dion and returns him as Bahamut, Warden of Light, a 5/5 Saga with
# flying. Chapter I (Wings of Light) puts a +1/+1 counter on each other creature Bot1 controls, the Knight token and Savannah Lions,
# which fly until end of turn; chapter II does it again on turn 5. Chapter III (Gigaflare) on turn 7 destroys Bot2's Savannah Lions
# and then exiles Bahamut and returns him front face up: Dion enters anew, making another Knight token.

